\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. COME, Holy Ghost, Thine influence shed,
\par And realize the sign;
\par Thy life infuse into the bread,
\par Thy power into the wine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Effectual let the tokens prove
\par And made, by heavenly art,
\par Fit channels to convey Thy love
\par To every faithful heart.
\par                     Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

